# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. This repo is developed on Windows, where
# git would otherwise check them out with CRLF — and a `#!/bin/sh\r` shebang is
# not a valid interpreter path inside the Linux container, so docker-entrypoint.sh
# would fail with "no such file or directory" on a line that looks perfectly fine.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for the SQL the migration runner feeds to Postgres.
*.sql text eol=lf
